WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.400
One box, and nothing in it.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.400
You do not know what to type.

3
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.400
So you invent something. It names no site.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.700
Three ideas. Six real companies.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.500
Only the choice of companies is curated.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Everything else is fetched when you click.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.700
So the companies go in the box.

8
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.500
And the real parser reads them back out.

9
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.800
But it is a promise about somebody else's site.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.300
One command. Six for six on pricing.

11
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:42.000
Two companies is four minutes. That is what is left.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.100
It steps over the gap. It does not close it.

13
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.800
Somewhere to start.
